            <note corresp="#d75-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d75-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 795.00/8–1055. Secret. Drafted by
                        Jones and approved by McClurkin. Also sent to London, Paris, Stockholm, Bern, and
                    Tokyo.</p>
            </note>
